WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:100%,end
On the My units card, the next service is coloured.
Green is far off, yellow is close, red is overdue.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:100%,end
Red: ABC-123, the service is overdue.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:100%,end
Yellow: KKK-777, the service is inside the reminder limit.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:100%,end
Green: PK-220, the next service is still a way off.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000 line:100%,end
Open the machine. Enter km / hours is for readings.
Report defect / observation is a different button.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000 line:100%,end
Enter kilometres or hours and press Save.
After that you see the colour of the next service.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000 line:100%,end
Report defect / observation opens the description.
A reading is not required there.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000 line:100%,end
Add photo is as large a button as Save.
Five photos fit.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000 line:100%,end
Not roadworthy needs a description.
Save stays off until you write what is wrong.
